# Read-modify-write (`+=`, `++`) on class fields across package boundaries, where
# the field's slot comes from a reconstructed rec group rather than a local class
# declaration: an imported class's own field, an imported field inherited by a
# subclass in a third package, and expression-position postfix on both.
# name            dir        deps                          root
@test/counters    counters   -
@test/tickers     tickers    @test/counters
main              app        @test/counters,@test/tickers  root
